# ============================================================================
# ETL pipeline schedule — ENABLE ON DEPLOYMENT.
# Not installed automatically. To turn it on: fill in the <SCHEDULE> and the
# absolute <REPO_PATH>, then add these lines with `crontab -e`.
#
# Keep the fast-loop cadence in sync with config/pipeline.yml -> ingest.interval_minutes.
# ============================================================================

# --- FAST LOOP: pull new data from the APIs and upsert (default: every 15 min) ---
# */15 * * * *  <REPO_PATH>/scripts/ingest.sh          >> <REPO_PATH>/logs/ingest.log 2>&1

# --- NIGHTLY LOOP: recompute is_active / status as-of today (default: 02:00) ---
# 0 2 * * *     <REPO_PATH>/scripts/refresh_active.sh  >> <REPO_PATH>/logs/refresh_active.log 2>&1
